	<section_number>55.1-103</section_number>
	<catch_line>Suicide or attainder of felony</catch_line>
	<text>
		Neither suicide nor attainder of felony shall cause a corruption of blood or forfeiture of estate.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1919, § 4762; Code 1950, § 55-4; 2019, c. 712.</history>
